    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro</strong> is a multiplayer first person shooter in <strong>zero gravity</strong>. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a new\u00a0addictive  take on <strong>movement shooters</strong>, you can turbo, grapple, teleport, slide, kick, and more to reach top speeds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off this adrenaline pumping movement in the first <strong>arena-style maps</strong> designed specifically with all possible directions in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose loadouts containing a variety of <strong>unique items</strong> from classic fps guns to boomerangs and boomboxes. Additionally, customize your choice of gadgets and supers to create a user experience perfectly tailored to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends for a full stack, or join forces officially by banding together in your own <strong>Crew</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no description can ever do Astro justice, you need to experience the thrills of zero gravity combat yourself.\u00a0<u>Ready to redefine your idea of what a first person shooter can be?</u> Dive into Astro!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro</strong> is a multiplayer first person shooter in <strong>zero gravity</strong>. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a new\u00a0addictive  take on <strong>movement shooters</strong>, you can turbo, grapple, teleport, slide, kick, and more to reach top speeds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off this adrenaline pumping movement in the first <strong>arena-style maps</strong> designed specifically with all possible directions in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose loadouts containing a variety of <strong>unique items</strong> from classic fps guns to boomerangs and boomboxes. Additionally, customize your choice of gadgets and supers to create a user experience perfectly tailored to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends for a full stack, or join forces officially by banding together in your own <strong>Crew</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no description can ever do Astro justice, you need to experience the thrills of zero gravity combat yourself.\u00a0<u>Ready to redefine your idea of what a first person shooter can be?</u> Dive into Astro!</p>",
